{
  "bodyHash": "3faeec260c2c79b1",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span><span><strong>本模組新增了多種多樣且互不相關的物品、工具、機器、附魔與幾種藥水。<br></strong></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><strong>為了了解本模組，建議安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patchouli</a> 模組，並查看「Cyclic Guide Book」物品（適用於 1.16 及以上版本）。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>對於 1.12 版本，則有使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/guide-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Guide API</a> 編寫的類似導覽書。</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>整合包開發者可在此查看範例設定檔與腳本 <a href=\"https://github.com/Lothrazar/Cyclic/tree/trunk/1.20/examples\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡&nbsp;</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>必要依賴項</h3>\n<p>在 Minecraft 1.20 及更新版本中，Cyclic 現在依賴此函式庫模組 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/flib\" rel=\"nofollow\">FLIB</a>，以及許多其他模組。（舊版 Minecraft 仍無需任何依賴項，且此函式庫將不會向後移植）</p>\n<h2>選用依賴項</h2>\n<p>Cyclic 並不強制要求安裝以下任何模組，但如果同時安裝了這些模組，Cyclic 內建的某些功能會獲得增強。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crafttweaker\" rel=\"nofollow\">CraftTweaker</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patchouli</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如需下載舊版本，請點擊網站上的「Files」然後選擇「View All」，並使用下拉選單篩選。以下是部分捷徑：</p>\n<p><span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cyclic/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:6170\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.10.2</a></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cyclic/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:6756\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.12.2</a></strong> </span></p>\n<p><span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cyclic/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:70886\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Minecraft 1.16.5</strong></a> </span></p>\n<p><span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cyclic/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=1738749986:73250\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Minecraft 1.18.2</strong></a></span></p>\n<p><span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cyclic/files/all?filter-status=1&filter-game-version=2020709689:9366\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Minecraft 1.19.2</strong></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><a href=\"https://github.com/Lothrazar/Cyclic/tree/trunk/1.12/scripts_zen_example\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Minecraft 1.12 Crafttweaker 範例</strong></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><strong>設定檔：請查看您遊戲目錄中 /mods/ 資料夾旁的 /config/ 資料夾內的已產生設定檔。您也可以透過 Issues 連結前往 GitHub 網站查看範例設定檔。此模組的所有版本均包含一個或多個設定檔<br></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong>例如 1.16.5 等新版本包含 <a href=\"https://github.com/Lothrazar/Cyclic/blob/trunk/1.18/cyclic.toml\" rel=\"nofollow\">cyclic.toml</a> 與 <a href=\"https://github.com/Lothrazar/Cyclic/blob/trunk/1.18/cyclic-client.toml\" rel=\"nofollow\">cyclic-client.toml</a> 檔案。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong>而 1.12.2 版本則包含兩個設定檔：<a href=\"https://github.com/Lothrazar/Cyclic/blob/trunk/1.12/cyclicmagic.cfg\" rel=\"nofollow\">cyclicmagic.cfg</a> 與 cyclic_ores.cfg。</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>技術資訊 - 使用的第三方工具</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>音效使用 BFXR 製作 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.bfxr.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://www.bfxr.net/</a></p>\n<p>部分模型在 Crayfish Model Creator 的協助下完成 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmrcrayfish.com%252ftools%253fid%253dmc\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://mrcrayfish.com/tools?id=mc</a></p>\n<p>程式碼基於 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Forge API</a> 撰寫，使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.eclipse.org%252fdownloads%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eclipse</a> 與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgradle.org%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gradle</a> 進行開發<br>貼圖使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.getpaint.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Paint.net</a> 製作</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;開源專案致謝！</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>秉持開源精神，特別感謝在 Cyclic 中曾借用少量程式碼的其他模組作者：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Botania - <a href=\"https://github.com/PrinceOfAmber/Cyclic/blob/0b75dedf899a086414b16cb8ce3bcc62cc5b4c9d/src/main/java/com/lothrazar/cyclicmagic/util/Vector3.java\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vector3 類別</a></li>\n<li>Not Enough Wands - <a href=\"https://github.com/PrinceOfAmber/Cyclic/blob/master/src/main/java/com/lothrazar/cyclicmagic/util/UtilWorld.java#L252\" rel=\"nofollow\">OpenGL 渲染函數</a></li>\n<li>Builders Guides - <a href=\"https://github.com/PrinceOfAmber/Cyclic/blob/master/src/main/java/com/lothrazar/cyclicmagic/util/UtilWorld.java#L324\" rel=\"nofollow\">OpenGL 渲染函數</a></li>\n<li>Random Things - <a href=\"https://github.com/PrinceOfAmber/Cyclic/blob/0b61a4d1dd6b8d5732f69674b62282068ca3be19/src/main/java/com/lothrazar/cyclicmagic/component/miner/TileEntityBlockMiner.java#L28\" rel=\"nofollow\">使用假玩家（FakePlayers）讓方塊實體影響世界</a></li>\n<li>Baubles - <a href=\"https://github.com/PrinceOfAmber/Cyclic/blob/d8a0790298feae7a38f5f378661284f273a164d5/src/main/java/com/lothrazar/cyclicmagic/util/UtilPlayerInventoryFilestorage.java#L17\" rel=\"nofollow\">將玩家物品堆疊儲存至二進位檔案</a></li>\n<li>Vanilla Automation - <a href=\"https://github.com/PrinceOfAmber/Cyclic/blob/d8a0790298feae7a38f5f378661284f273a164d5/src/main/java/com/lothrazar/cyclicmagic/proxy/ClientProxy.java#L267\" rel=\"nofollow\">使用 PlayerControllerMP 更改玩家互動距離</a></li>\n<li>Sponge -<a href=\"https://github.com/PrinceOfAmber/Cyclic/issues/143\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 協助解決網路封包、多執行緒、並發異常及排程伺服器任務等問題</a></li>\n<li>Ellpeck (AA) 提供了部分<a href=\"https://github.com/PrinceOfAmber/Cyclic/blob/db9728eeb846c5a5dfa495c792895fc64fb961a3/src/main/java/com/lothrazar/cyclicmagic/block/base/TileEntityBaseMachineInvo.java#L144\" rel=\"nofollow\">優雅的能量傳輸程式碼</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;教學 / 指南 / 參考資源致謝！</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fbedrockminer.jimdo.com%252fmodding-tutorials%252fbasic-modding-1-7%252fcustom-tools-swords%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">工具製作</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fminecraft.gamepedia.com%252fExperience%2523Leveling_up\" rel=\"nofollow\">玩家經驗值系統</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%252ftopic%252c7146.0.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">尋找既有合成配方</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fgreyminecraftcoder.blogspot.com.au%252f2015%252f01%252ftileentity.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">方塊實體（Tile Entity）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fmodwiki.temporal-reality.com%252fmw%252findex.php%252fRender_Block_TESR_%252f_OBJ-1.9\" rel=\"nofollow\">TESR（即時渲染方塊實體）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/modification-development/1432714-forge-using-addinformation-on-a-block\" rel=\"nofollow\">ItemBlock 中繼資料</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fwiki%252fContainers_and_GUIs\" rel=\"nofollow\">GUI 介面</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252ftopic%252f28330-solvedtileentity-implementing-iupdateplayerlistbox-only-working-clientside%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">進階方塊實體</a>&nbsp;以及 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d31953.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">這篇</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d30567.\" rel=\"nofollow\">粒子效果</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d29544.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">方塊狀態變更</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d25937.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">方塊旋轉</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d39162.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">客戶端與伺服器同步</a>&nbsp;以及 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d38710.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">這篇</a>&nbsp;與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d15351.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">這篇</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fjabelarminecraft.blogspot.ca%252fp%252fminecraft-forge-creating-custom.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">成就系統</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fgreyminecraftcoder.blogspot.ca%252f2014%252f12%252ftransparent-blocks-18.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">方塊透明度</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d22378.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">GUI 文字輸入</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d31853.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">客戶端 Proxy 技巧</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d38076.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">自訂音效</a>&nbsp;以及 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d37547.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">這篇</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/mapping-and-modding-tutorials/1571434-tutorial-modding-with-apis\" rel=\"nofollow\">使用模組 API（如 JEI 或 Baubles）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d27684.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">Proxy 渲染</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d11024.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">藥水</a>&nbsp;與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d12358.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">藥水貼圖</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d24403.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">圓形與球體繪製</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252ftopic%252f37202-19-playerinteractevent-for-right-click-no-longer-works%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">玩家事件</a>&nbsp;以及 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d31966.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">這篇</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252findex.php%253ftopic%253d43152.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">實體傷害計算</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraftforge.net%252fforum%252ftopic%252f29593-18-solveddisplay-gui-when-interacting-with-an-entity%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">村民介面</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>音效來源</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>門鈴音效來源：</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fsoundbible.com%252f1599-Store-Door-Chime.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://soundbible.com/1599-Store-Door-Chime.html</a><br>&nbsp;授權條款：創用 CC 姓名標示 3.0 <br>&nbsp;錄製者：Mike Koenig</p>\n<ul>\n<li>所有其他<a href=\"https://github.com/PrinceOfAmber/Cyclic/graphs/contributors\" rel=\"nofollow\">貢獻者</a>與翻譯人員</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>經典整合包：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://mods.curse.com/modpacks/minecraft/247972-we-gonna-die\" rel=\"nofollow\">We Gonna Die</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://mods.curse.com/modpacks/minecraft/251861-ftb-presents-hermitpack\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB HermitPack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://mods.curse.com/modpacks/minecraft/247107-beyond-vanilla-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Beyond-Vanilla</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://mods.curse.com/modpacks/minecraft/229466-material-energy-ex-1-10-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Material Energy^Ex</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://mods.curse.com/modpacks/minecraft/233380-shadowlands-basic-mods\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shadowlands</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://mods.curse.com/modpacks/minecraft/246156-technologyadvanced\" rel=\"nofollow\">Technology Advanced</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://mods.curse.com/modpacks/minecraft/252320-overpowered-non-content\" rel=\"nofollow\">Overpowered Non-Content</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://mods.curse.com/modpacks/minecraft/252898-hyperantix\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hyper Antix</a></li>\n<li>Nameless Pack (JonBams)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/the-modded-way-pixelmon\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Modded Way Pixelmon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://mods.curse.com/modpacks/minecraft/255419-couplecraft-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">CoupleCraft 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://mods.curse.com/modpacks/minecraft/254202-farming-valley\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farming Valley</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://mods.curse.com/modpacks/minecraft/243934-the-new-frontier\" rel=\"nofollow\">The New Frontier</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://mods.curse.com/modpacks/minecraft/256546-we-gonna-die-again\" rel=\"nofollow\">We Gonna Die Again</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/all-the-mods-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">All The Mods 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.atlauncher.com%252fpack%252fMechMagic\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mech &amp; Magic</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/hypothermia\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hypothermia</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/skills-not-included-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Skills Not Included</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/enigmatica2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enigmatica 2</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><a href=\"https://github.com/Lothrazar/Cyclic/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span>請將所有功能建議、錯誤回報、問題說明與崩潰日誌提交至 GitHub Issues 頁面</span></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
